      "closed_at": "2021-09-02T17:12:09Z",
      "body": "In normal channels, we use `no template` as a shortcut for `just chat only`.\r\n\r\nBut, this result in some players being offered the `Chat` template in the Collaborative Working channel, but those messages can't be rendered.\r\n\r\nSo, if it's a special collab working channel, and the player only has `Chat` template (or no template), don't offer `New Message`.",
